<title>USA: AMEX closing averages.</title>
<headline>AMEX closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the American Stock Exchange closed higher in heavy trading.</p>
<p>The Amex Composite index rose 3.80 to 634.20.</p>
<p>The average price per share was up $0.08.</p>
<p>Advancers beat decliners 303 to 252.</p>
<p>Preliminary volume was 27,386,140 compared with 24,376,730 on Monday.</p>
<p>(Prices official as of 1630 EDT/2030 GMT)</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk, 212-859-1830))</p>
</text>
